<title>SINGAPORE: Hong Leong Finance says foreigners hold 19.57 pct.</title>
<headline>Hong Leong Finance says foreigners hold 19.57 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Leong Finance Ltd said on Tuesday foreign shareholdings in the issued share capital of the company was at 19.57 percent on December 31 1996.</p>
<p>A company statement said the percentage included 167,996 shares held by shareholders whose nationalities it was unable to determine as the required information had not been supplied.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
